# The really important pattern

When I line these projects up, I don't see:

> "Lucy was just a talented coder who happened to win some hackathons."

I see a **product-learning loop**.

### Project 1: civic problem

**Can technology make navigation safer?**

↓

### Project 2: information problem

**Can I move information seamlessly between web and phone?**

↓

### Project 3: education/problem-solving

**Can programming education become a game?**

↓

### Project 4: logistics

**Can ordinary people become delivery infrastructure?**

↓

### Project 5: social discovery

**Can software manufacture spontaneity and connect nearby people?**

↓

### Project 6: education

**Can teachers create their own multiplayer educational games?**

That is a young product builder trying lots of hypotheses.

