So I don't think we should literally say:

> "Lucy submitted the PennApps EduGames project to Thiel."

That can't be right chronologically.

Rather, the evidence suggests **EduGames was the continuation/evolution of the idea she had submitted to Thiel**.

And that actually makes the story more interesting.

