[1]: https://neweconomies.podhood.com/2fb24e20-16d7-468a-9484-af34c832f283?utm_source=chatgpt.com "The Youngest Female BILLIONAIRE Told Us THIS — NEW ECONOMIES | Transcript & Key Moments"

