[2]: https://pod.wave.co/podcast/aspire-with-emma-grede/the-aspire-playbook-how-lucy-guo-a-rebel-girl-in-a-mans-world-became-the-worlds--0790f140?utm_source=chatgpt.com "The Aspire Playbook: How Lucy Guo, a Rebel Girl in a Man’s World, Became the World’s Youngest Self-Made Female Billionaire | Aspire with Emma Grede"
[3]: https://www.marketscreener.com/news/latest/Peter-Thiel-Announces-2014-Class-of-Thiel-Fellows-18550416/?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Peter Thiel Announces 2014 Class of Thiel Fellows | MarketScreener"
